<title>DENMARK: Danish August current account surplus 2.0 bln DKK.</title>
<headline>Danish August current account surplus 2.0 bln DKK.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's current account surplus stood at 2.0 billion crowns in August, from a revised 0.8 billion crown surplus in July, the national statistics office said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
